<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's May unemployment rate rises to 2.6 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's May unemployment rate rises to 2.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's seasonally-adjusted unemployment rate rose to 2.6 percent in May from 2.0 percent a year earlier, the National Statistical Office said on Sunday.</p>
<p>					    MAY 97   APR 97   MAY 96</p>
<p>    Unemployment rate (pct)	    2.6	2.7	2.0</p>
<p>						(2.5)    (2.8)    (1.9)</p>
<p>Ratio of economically</p>
<p>	active population		 63.2     63.0     62.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Rates in brackets calculated before taking seasonal factors into account.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
